      <li>Concentric = lift. Eccentric = lower. Isometric = hold.</li>
      <li>None is "best". Each suits a different stage and goal.</li>
      <li>Most good rehab moves from holds, to slow heavy work, to speed and sport.</li>
    </ul></div>
